### ── SINK: Ghi thẳng page-view vào D1 ────────────────────────────────────────

### [14] Ghi page view qua endpoint cũ (ghi thẳng vào D1 pageview_daily)
POST {{host}}/api/analytics/page-view HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ── BASIN QUERY: Admin API xem analytics ────────────────────────────────────

### [15] Xem chatbot analytics 24h (Basin query từ D1 chatbot_events)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/analytics/chatbot HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### [16] Xem page-view analytics 7 ngày (Basin query từ D1 pageview_daily)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/analytics?days=7 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### [17] Xem tổng quan cửa hàng (products, orders, customers)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/summary HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
